下醫肚。揀咗呢間牛肉火鍋，坐低嗰陣見到餐廳入面燈光偏暗，柔和嘅黃光打落嚟，感覺幾舒服。我哋坐咗喺窗邊卡位，可以望到出面街景啲人來來往","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0rLN301"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/34/2GU4/0HJQAC63BACD7080EBF924px.jpg","time":"2026-09-04T00:59:59+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0rBp101"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/34/2GU4/0HJQAB95C137B44EFA8F29px.jpg","time":"2026-09-04T00:59:59+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0qxp101"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/34/2GU4/0HJQAA64253FDCE250F677px.jpg","time":"2026-09-04T00:59:59+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0qhp101"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2GD9/0HGECR00C44BFA26F3853Fpx.jpg","time":"2026-08-10T19:24:54+08:00","caption":"雪花其實係肥牛嚟，油脂分布幾靚，食落夠滑，係我全晚最鍾意嘅肉。❄️","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0grszW1"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2GD9/0HGECQCD54B4AF3E67984Bpx.jpg","time":"2026-08-10T19:24:54+08:00","caption":"蝦同蜆都幾新鮮，落鍋滾兩滾就食得，蝦肉爽口，蜆肉都冇沙。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0gbszW1"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2GD9/0HGECPC3F360D577136FB3px.jpg","time":"2026-08-10T19:24:54+08:00","caption":"龍蝦豬骨湯底，一上枱已經聞到好香。飲咗啖湯，幾濃郁，用嚟淥海鮮同牛肉都幾夾。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0gLszW1"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2GD9/0HGECO7DE5FA0313E19CE3px.jpg","time":"2026-08-10T19:24:54+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0g5szW1"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2G7Q/0HFAZR1D5FB0CB3EE7519Apx.jpg","time":"2026-08-03T11:00:37+08:00","caption":"我自己最深印象反而係吊龍。輕輕涮幾下已經得，入口軟身，牛味又出，唔會一味得個嫩字。配返少少沙茶就夠，食完會想即刻再落多碟。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0PvQz01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2G7Q/0HFAZQABB8D49620FE7F19px.jpg","time":"2026-08-03T11:00:37+08:00","caption":"呢個拼盤上枱幾企理，種類唔算花巧，但勝在新鮮。落湯之後食落幾甜，口感爽口，唔會有腥味。用龍蝦豬骨湯去帶，成件事幾順，海鮮味都出得幾自然🦐","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0PfQz01"},{"full":"https://